  <item>
    <title>怒江溜索与登梗澡堂，念念不忘的滇西小环线</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f1e3ee6fa9c45987e07b6a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f1e3ee6fa9c45987e07b6a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 11:28:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好~~</span></p><p><span>在前段时间，Chloe与伴侣进行了为期一周的滇西小环线自驾之旅，作为自己的毕业旅行，从藏式风味的香格里拉到略带遗憾的梅里雪山，从悠闲躺平的腾冲到充满缅甸风情的芒市与瑞丽，这一段旅行又是不一样的风格与风光，但其实让Chloe最念念不忘的素。。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">00:03:16</a> 苏州出差具有电影感的一幕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">00:10:20</a> 丽江与虎跳峡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">00:18:02</a> 梅里雪山的月照银山</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">00:24:50</a> 人神共居之地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">00:27:00</a> 怒江溜索</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">00:28:50</a> Chloe怒推：登梗澡堂！！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">00:36:00</a> 腾冲躺平三天，捡漏的民宿是本次最大惊喜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">00:48:00</a> 芒市好吃好吃好吃米西米西米西</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3364">00:56:04</a> 缅式洗头值得一试</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3499">00:58:19</a> 瑞丽口岸打卡600一瓶的茅台</span></p><p><span>希望大家喜欢这期节目~也希望给有去滇西游玩的朋友们提供一些参考~~</span></p><p></p><p><span>Email：bulaoyouji@163.com</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
