    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前几天，Ivan看了gaga在日本的最后一场演唱会，也是格莱美表演前的最后一场表演，也顺便在日本玩了玩，整体体验给到夯！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">00:02:11</a>:准备工作：签证、西瓜卡、手机卡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">00:04:18</a> 酒店提前入住？按小时计费</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">00:09:00</a>: 和牛寿喜锅自助，意料之外的惊喜&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">00:13:01</a>:午夜的东京塔，临时收到法院传票</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">00:16:00</a>:银座初体验&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">00:18:59</a>: 出发看gaga！被中国人包围，所有人变装，应援双胞胎！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">00:26:01</a>:独特应援文化！双胞胎、手势和炫技！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">00:30:22</a>:八番宫祈福：小动物们一切都好！给钓鱼佬的御守</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">00:34:00</a>: 日本小电器城</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">00:35:23</a>:成人用品大楼（小绿楼、小红楼、小黄楼）：全是落落大方的中国女生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">00:42:10</a>:711鸡排、现制奶昔、一兰拉面、浅草寺大吉、朝日总部skybar</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2808">00:46:48</a>:为了一般般的寿司，差点误机！（ps：skyliner需提前买票</span></p><p><span>希望大家喜欢~~</span></p><p><span>Email bulaoyouji@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
